msgid "Sysstat - 系统性能分析套件"
msgstr "Sysstat - System Performance Analysis Suite"

#: ../../linux/sysstat/index.rst:6
msgid "Sysstat 软件包包含许多商业Unix通用的各种实用程序，用于监视系统性能和使用活动:"
msgstr "The Sysstat package contains a variety of utilities common to commercial Unix systems, used to monitor system performance and usage activity:"

#: ../../linux/sysstat/index.rst:17
msgid "Sysstat 还包含可以通过 cron 或 systemd 安排的工具来收集和历史记录性能和活动数据："
msgstr "Sysstat also includes tools that can be scheduled via cron or systemd to collect and keep a historical record of performance and activity data:"

